# Regenerable scrub scratch (naming wave): per-artifact copies of the PRE-rename upstream
# source tree used to prove the dist rewrites were byte-identical after scrubbing. Never a
# deliverable — it carries the very upstream naming this repository purged, 8.8 MB / 1208
# files, and one command regenerates any artifact:
#   node evidence/mpd-naming/wave2/raw/build-repro.mjs <artifact> --apply-scrub --compare
evidence/**/raw/scratch/
